---
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Résumé | MD Anik Hasan"
  description="Semantic HTML résumé for MD Anik Hasan, including current focus, education, verified projects, services, and public technical skills."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Build record"
    title="Résumé"
    intro="A printable record of what I am building, what I can prove publicly, and the two services I offer. It avoids skill bars and inflated proficiency labels."
    workshop="Build Record"
  />

  <article class="resume-sheet">
    <header>
      <h2>MD Anik Hasan</h2>
      <p>Website and software developer · Solo founder of Boilabin</p>
      <p>Dhaka, Bangladesh · <a href="https://mdanikhasan.com">mdanikhasan.com</a></p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="resume-summary">
      <h3 id="resume-summary">Summary</h3>
      <p>
        Computer Science and Engineering student and independent software builder. Building Boilabin
        as a pre-launch ecommerce startup for Bangladesh. Available for website development and
        custom software development, with public proof in native Windows software and Python
        automation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="resume-current">
      <h3 id="resume-current">Current work</h3>
      <dl>
        <div>
          <dt>Boilabin</dt>
          <dd>Solo founder and builder · Pre-launch ecommerce startup under active development.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Salty Potato AI</dt>
          <dd>
            Experimental decoder-only language model, tokenizer, data pipeline, training,
            checkpoints, inference, and desktop software.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="resume-projects">
      <h3 id="resume-projects">Selected built projects</h3>
      <dl>
        <div>
          <dt><a href="/work/soctukit/">SoctuKit</a></dt>
          <dd>
            Native Windows product using C#, .NET 8, WinUI 3, Windows App SDK, XAML, MVVM,
            Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting, xUnit, FluentAssertions, Inno Setup, and Windows
            Credential Manager.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt><a href="/work/uiu-discord-bot/">UIU Discord Bot</a></dt>
          <dd>
            Python and discord.py automation for UIU notices, duplicate prevention, automatic
            posting, academic calendar information, server utilities, and slash commands.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="resume-services">
      <h3 id="resume-services">Services</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Website development</li>
        <li>Custom software development, including focused native Windows work</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="resume-tools">
      <h3 id="resume-tools">Languages and verified technology</h3>
      <p>
        Python is my strongest current practical confidence. I have also worked with C, C++, Java,
        TypeScript, C#, .NET, WinUI 3, and XAML.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="resume-education">
      <h3 id="resume-education">Education</h3>
      <p>
        Computer Science and Engineering, United International University (UIU), Dhaka, Bangladesh.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
